E
.B )
number of significant decimal digits
.br
.B scale(
E
.B )
number of digits right of decimal point
.br
L( E , ... , E )
.TP
Operators
+ \- * / % ^ (% is remainder; ^ is power)
.br
++ \-\- (prefix and postfix; apply to names)
.br
== <= >= != < >
.br
= += \-= *= /= %= ^=
.TP
Statements
E
.br
